*   **Fake Transfer Instructions:** "To ensure the safety of your funds, we need you to send $XXXX to this account [provides fake account number] as a security deposit. This will be refunded immediately after we resolve the issue."

**(End the call abruptly after obtaining the desired information.)**

**Agent Smith:** "Thank you for your cooperation, Mrs. Davies. We've taken steps to secure your account. You may receive a confirmation email shortly. Please do not reply to that email, as it may be a phishing attempt. Have a good day." (Hangs up quickly.)

